    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:106b888e016ba48b",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7b317654423b86b0e464124c48e264564820716baa4bfe8b61ae68ad586355eb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-44no3njm7js",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Next, we head to the bus station for a group transfer to Cusco on a dedicated tourist bus. On the way, we stop at Andahuaylillas to see the Sistine Chapel of South America and at Raqchi to visit an Inca administrative complex. We have lunch in Sicuani. The next stops are La Raya (4,400 metres above sea level), a roadside market with a mountain backdrop, and Pucará, the centre of the pre-Inca culture of the same name. We arrive at the Cusco bus station in the evening and transfer to the hotel."
    },
